# 锐捷设备 show interfaces status 命令解析模板
# 获取端口名称、状态(up/down)、VLAN、双工模式、速率、类型
# 支持所有接口类型：FastEthernet, GigabitEthernet, TenGigE, VLAN, Loopback 等
# 示例输出：
# Interface                                Status    Vlan   Duplex   Speed     Type
# ---------------------------------------- --------  ----   -------  --------- ------
# GigabitEthernet 1/1                      down      318    Unknown  Unknown   copper
# GigabitEthernet 1/2                      up        318    Full     10M       copper
#
# Phase 48 D-10 (RESEARCH Pitfall 5): the up-interface list extracted
# from this template feeds the transceiver collector's pre-filter so
# that empty SFP cages are skipped. STATUS was previously discarded as
# `\S+` (skipped group); it is now a captured variable so the Go-side
# collector can filter `status=="up"` rows.

Value Required INTERFACE (\S+(?:\s+[\d/]+)?)
Value STATUS (up|down)
Value VLAN (\d+|--)
Value DUPLEX (\S+|--)
Value SPEED (\S+|--)
Value TYPE (.*|--)

Start
  ^Interface\s+Status\s+Vlan\s+Duplex\s+Speed\s+Type
  ^-+\s+-+\s+-+\s+-+\s+-+\s+-+
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${STATUS}\s+${VLAN}\s+${DUPLEX}\s+${SPEED}\s+${TYPE} -> Record
